@startuml
title UC-001 — Isolated behavioral eval case execution
note as N
Product Spec UC-001
end note
actor "workflow maintainer/user" as Maintainer
actor "Codex agent" as Codex
actor harness as Harness
actor "evaluator/reviewer" as Evaluator
actor "controlled external systems" as External
rectangle "Behavioral Eval case" {
  usecase "Define case, Required Outcome,\nHard Gates, quality threshold" as Define
  usecase "Provision disposable isolated\nworkspace and recording" as Provision
  usecase "Execute real workflow" as Execute
  usecase "Validate gates and outcome;\nscore task/trajectory quality" as Evaluate
  usecase "Retain trajectory, evidence,\nand case result" as Retain
  usecase "Reset workspace and isolation" as Reset
}
Maintainer --> Define
Define --> Provision
Harness --> Provision
Harness --> Execute
Codex --> Execute
External --> Execute
Execute --> Evaluate
Evaluator --> Evaluate
Evaluate --> Retain
Harness --> Retain
Retain --> Reset
Harness --> Reset
note right of Execute
fail_fast side-effect violations stop immediately;
non-side-effect policy violations continue
to completion and end failed.
end note
@enduml
